lse,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-01-07T21:40:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T17:52:51Z","closed_at":"2025-11-20T17:16:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101247","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101247","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101247.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101247.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-20T17:16:51Z"},"body":"I cleaned up all `String` find-like functions. They were very inconsistent implementation wise, unnecessarily long, and had one or two opportunities for optimization.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n- Abstracted ranged string compare into `string_equal_lower`, to make implementations simpler.\r\n- Made variable names consistent.\r\n- Shortened implementation where possible.\r\n- Moved bounds checks out of the loop (-> 10% speed up).\r\n- Used `memcmp` where possible (-> 2x speed up).\r\n- I missed that one of the two implementations had `if (src_len == 1)` already. Due to my check added in #100024, this branch is no longer necessary.\r\n- Added a few edge case tests.\r\n\r\nI'm pretty sure the new code doesn't change any behavior, except print no errors if `p_from` was too large on `find`.\r\n\r\n### Benchmark\r\n\r\nMy changes can improve string-string case sensitive finds (`find`, `rfind`, `findmk`) by 2x:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\tString s1 = \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\";\r\n\tString s2 = \"Ut enim ad minim veniam\";\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < 10000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t\t// Test\r\n\t\t\tint r = s1.find(s2);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\t\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\n- `2131ms` on master (5b52b4b5c4f7c1232a6a814f65fce4c48f0f424b)\r\n- `1054ms` on this PR (3e000ed43dd6905f77c4840d1ab49bc443ab6cb7)\r\n\r\nAll other find functions will experience a ~10% speed up (tested earlier).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101247/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101247/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}